---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions — RealEditPDF"
  description="The terms and conditions governing the use of RealEditPDF online PDF tools and services."
  activeTool="editor"
>
  <div class="py-12 md:py-20 hero-mesh-gradient border-b border-hairline">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-display text-ink break-words">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 text-[14px] sm:text-[16px] text-body max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Please read these Terms & Conditions carefully before using RealEditPDF services.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-canvas">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8 sm:space-y-12">
      <!-- 1. Acceptance -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-5 sm:p-8 shadow-whisper space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-ink">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-body">
          By accessing or using RealEditPDF, you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you disagree with any part of these terms, you may not access the service.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Use License -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-5 sm:p-8 shadow-whisper space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-ink">2. Use License</h2>
        <ul class="list-decimal list-inside text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-body">
          <li>Permission is granted to temporarily download one copy of the materials (information or software) on RealEditPDF's website for personal, non-commercial transitory viewing only</li>
          <li>This grant constitutes a license, not a transfer of title, and under this license you may not: modify or copy the materials; use the materials for any commercial purpose, or any public display (commercial or non-commercial); attempt to reverse engineer or unbind any software contained on RealEditPDF's website</li>
          <li>This license shall automatically terminate if you violate any of these restrictions and may be terminated by RealEditPDF at any time</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Disclaimer -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-5 sm:p-8 shadow-whisper space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-ink">3. Disclaimer</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-body">
          <li>The materials on RealEditPDF's website are provided on an 'as is' basis. RealEditPDF makes no warranties, expressed or implied, and hereby disclaims and negates all other warranties, including without limitation, implied warranties or conditions of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement of intellectual property.</li>
          <li>RealEditPDF does not warrant or make any representations concerning the accuracy, likely results, or reliability of the use of the materials on its internet website.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Limitation of Liability -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-5 sm:p-8 shadow-whisper space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-ink">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-body">
          In no event shall RealEditPDF or its suppliers be liable for any damages (including, without limitation, damages for loss of data or profit, or due to business interruption) arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on RealEditPDF's website, even if RealEditPDF or a RealEditPDF authorized representative has been made aware of the possibility of such damages.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Revisions and Errata -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-5 sm:p-8 shadow-whisper space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-ink">5. Revisions and Errata</h2>
        <p class="text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-body">
          The materials on RealEditPDF's website could include technical, typographical, or photographic errors. RealEditPDF does not warrant that any of the materials on its website are accurate, complete, or current. RealEditPDF may make changes to the materials contained on its website at any time without notice. However, RealEditPDF does not make any commitment to update the materials.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>